    %% Layer 0 - Humans
    Human[👤 Human User / Team<br/>Ramin Allazov & users] -->|Natural Language or Drag-Drop| App[🌐 Dirijor Canvas<br/>Next.js + React Flow 2.0<br/>Live Topology + Safety Metrics]

    %% Competitive Gap Layer
    Hostinger[🏠 Hostinger / Other VPS<br/>1-click OpenClaw Docker<br/>Single Agent + Basic Container] -.->|Raw Power<br/>But NO network canvas<br/>NO multi-agent consensus<br/>NO hallucination fortress| Dirijor

    %% Layer 1 - Control Plane
    App -->|WebSocket + API| Dirijor[🧠 Dirijor Core<br/>LangGraph Supervisor + A2A/MCP Router<br/>Cloud-Agnostic (incl. Hostinger VPS)]

    Dirijor <-->|Consensus & Routing| Safety[🛡️ Safety Fortress<br/>Multi-Agent Debate (≥95%)<br/>Verified Semantic Cache (Qdrant)<br/>Anomaly Auto-Quarantine<br/>Human-in-the-Loop + Audit Export]

    %% Layer 2 - Realm Management
    Dirijor -->|IaC Deploy| Realm[🏗️ Private Realm Manager<br/>Terraform/Pulumi Adapters<br/>Unlimited Instances]

    Realm -->|Adapter| Cloud[☁️ Any Private Cloud<br/>Hostinger VPS • DigitalOcean • Hetzner • Proxmox • Self-hosted • ...]

    %% Layer 3 - Network & Runtime Plane
    Cloud -->|Auto Provision| Mesh[🔒 Zero-Trust Private Mesh<br/>Headscale/Tailscale + mTLS + WireGuard<br/>Firecracker microVM Sandboxing]

    Mesh -->|Isolated Channels| Runtime[⚙️ Agent Runtime Plane<br/>Secure OpenClaw Wrapper<br/>+ Any other agents]

    Runtime -->|Wrapped & Sandboxed| OpenClaw[🦞 OpenClaw Agents<br/>Skills Marketplace<br/>Multi-Channel]

    OpenClaw <-->|Secure Tool Calls| External[🔌 Private Tools<br/>Browser • Shell • Email • Calendar]

    %% Observability & Marketplace
    Dirijor <-->|Traces + Hallucination Scores| Obs[📊 Observability<br/>Grafana + OpenTelemetry<br/>Live Consensus Heatmap]

    Obs -->|Real-time Dashboard + Audit Package| App

    Marketplace[🛒 Dirijor Agent Marketplace<br/>Verified Secure Swarm Templates] -->|Import → Auto-Sandbox| Realm

